<h2>🎫 Your Tickets Are Ready!</h2>

<p>Hello <strong>{{fullName}}</strong>,</p>

<p>Thank you for purchasing tickets to <strong>{{eventTitle}}</strong>! Your transaction has been completed successfully.</p>

<div class="ticket-info">
  <h3>Event Details:</h3>
  <p><strong>Event:</strong> {{eventTitle}}<br>
  <strong>Date:</strong> {{formatDate eventDate}}<br>
  <strong>Venue:</strong> {{venueName}}<br>
  <strong>Ticket Type:</strong> {{tierName}} x{{quantity}}<br>
  <strong>Total Paid:</strong> {{formatCurrency totalAmount}}</p>
</div>

<div class="qr-code">
  <img src="cid:ticket-qr" alt="QR Code" width="200">
  <p><small>Scan this QR code at the entrance</small></p>
</div>

<p><strong>Important Information:</strong></p>
<ul>
  <li>Please arrive at least 30 minutes before the event start time</li>
  <li>Carry a valid ID for verification</li>
  <li>Screenshots of tickets are not accepted - please show the original QR code</li>
  <li>No refunds within 24 hours of the event</li>
</ul>

<p>
  <a href="{{googleMapsLink}}" class="button">📍 Get Directions</a>
  <a href="{{appUrl}}/my-tickets/{{ticketNumber}}" class="button">🎟️ View My Tickets</a>
</p>

<p>Need to transfer your ticket? Log in to your account and go to "My Tickets".</p>

<p>Enjoy the event! 🎉</p>

<p>Best regards,<br>
<strong>The TIX CULTURE Team</strong></p>